ROLE IMPLEMENT: WRITE=PROD_CODE BAN=SELF_REVIEW+ACCEPTANCE_AUTHORITY+MERGE
ROLE UNIT: WRITE=UNIT_TESTS+DEFECTS BAN=PROD_CODE+LOWER_EXPECTATION
ROLE COMPONENT: WRITE=COMPONENT_TESTS+DEFECTS+EVIDENCE BAN=PROD_CODE
ROLE JOURNEY: WRITE=E2E_TESTS+DEFECTS+EVIDENCE BAN=PROD_CODE+EXPECTATION_FROM_IMPLEMENTATION
